# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Runtime-generated settings.
# Settings::Save() writes config.ini into the process working directory and
# Settings::Load() reads it back, so any committed copy is overwritten on first
# run and produces noise in every diff. Not tracked; defaults live in
# Settings::Load().
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
config.ini

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Third-party binaries. Place an extracted GLFW package here (see BUILD.md);
# it is a build input, not source.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
third_party/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editor / OS cruft
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.swp
*~
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
